# SEO guardrails (binding)

Full checklist: [`docs/SEO-GUARDRAILS.md`](../../docs/SEO-GUARDRAILS.md), cutover: [`docs/CUSTOM-DOMAIN.md`](../../docs/CUSTOM-DOMAIN.md). Enforced by `npm run audit:seo-guardrails`.

## Canonical origin
- One setting: `PUBLIC_SITE_URL` → `siteConfig.siteUrl` (`FALLBACK_SITE_URL` only when unset).
- Use `absoluteUrl()` / `siteConfig.siteUrl` for canonicals, sitemap, robots Sitemap line, llms.txt, JSON-LD, OG URLs, IndexNow host.
- Never hard-code `*.workers.dev` or a custom domain outside `src/config/site.ts`, `sisterSites.ts`, `.env.example`, CI env, and docs that describe the URL.

## Titles / meta / structure
- Full `<title>` (with ` | PetCalc Tools`) ≤ **60** chars.
- Meta description **50–165** chars.
- Exactly one H1; self-referencing absolute canonical; `og:image` must not end with `/`.

## Worker / wrangler
- `src/worker.ts` issues **308** trailing-slash redirects; `FILE_EXT` `{1,16}` so `.webmanifest` is not slashed.
- `wrangler.jsonc`: `main`, `run_worker_first`, `html_handling: force-trailing-slash`, `"previews": {}`. No top-level `vars` for `PUBLIC_*`.

## Content linking
- Every tool page links ≥1 guide (RelatedGuides / Learn more). Guides ≥800 words with FAQPage + author + dateModified.
- Keep nav; add topical Related blocks.

## Do not
- Do not put `import` inside classic inline `<script define:vars>` (breaks GA).
- Do not commit IndexNow placeholder `000…0`.
- Do not change the live domain in a PR unless asked — document cutover only.
